  "body": "For fixing https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5872 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4431\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * [Firefox](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5872)\n   * [Chrome](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5872#issuecomment-685942712)\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/28243\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1192701\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1701001\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=223751\n\nThe proposed behavior of the condition for opening popup by `window.open` (open a popup only when `width` is specified) is based on current Safari's behavior, that's changed from the current Chrome's behavior, so I expect not so much breakage by standardizing this.\n\nThe proposed behavior of `BarProp` values is based on current Chrome's behavior, so I expect not so much breakage from this as well.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6530/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 28, 2021, 5:45 PM UTC (edf59aa)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6530/3ad5159...edf59aa/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 28, 2021, 5:45 PM UTC (edf59aa)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6530/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 28, 2021, 5:45 PM UTC (edf59aa)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6530/3ad5159...edf59aa/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 28, 2021, 5:45 PM UTC (edf59aa)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6530/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 28, 2021, 5:45 PM UTC (edf59aa)\">/window-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6530/3ad5159...edf59aa/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 28, 2021, 5:45 PM UTC (edf59aa)\">diff</a> )",
